00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:21.206
that we're working
on as we speak.

00:05:21.206 --> 00:05:23.580
So first, let's chat about
this device that we're making.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:26.038
It will be able to measure your
heart rate and temperature.

00:05:26.038 --> 00:05:27.510
And between those
two data points,

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.760
