00:25:18.070 --> 00:25:20.470
So my goals for showing
you front ends to an IoT

00:25:20.470 --> 00:25:21.520
application are twofold.

00:25:21.520 --> 00:25:24.670
I wanted to show you real time
visualization and time slice

00:25:24.670 --> 00:25:26.590
