00:33:20.730 --> 00:33:22.300
So what color was I?

00:33:22.300 --> 00:33:23.070
I was blue.

00:33:23.070 --> 00:33:24.600
I want to be the coolest.

00:33:24.600 --> 00:33:26.092
I'm not the coolest.

