00:33:32.850 --> 00:33:34.290
Check that out.

00:33:34.290 --> 00:33:35.770
We're all pretty close though.

00:33:35.770 --> 00:33:38.950
So the question
has been answered.

00:33:38.950 --> 00:33:39.630
I get to be--

00:33:39.630 --> 00:33:40.560
