00:34:56.230 --> 00:34:56.969
that we're going on in here.

00:34:56.969 --> 00:34:59.219
But basically, we're taking
the BPM and the time stamp

00:34:59.219 --> 00:35:01.320
and scaling them so
they fit in the screen.

00:35:01.320 --> 00:35:03.432
And then, just rendering
a line across the screen.

00:35:03.432 --> 00:35:04.140
So, there you go.

00:35:04.140 --> 00:35:05.070
GABE WEISS: Sweet.

00:35:05.070 --> 00:35:06.750
Thank you, Rob.

00:35:06.750 --> 00:35:09.900
So let's go back to slides.

00:35:09.900 --> 00:35:10.400
Yep.

00:35:13.781 --> 00:35:14.280
All right.

00:35:14.280 --> 00:35:16.966
So to recap, since
the keynote went

00:35:16.966 --> 00:35:18.840
