trying to wrap us up so

00:35:18.840 --> 00:35:21.390
we get us all back on schedule.

00:35:21.390 --> 00:35:26.530
We built an entire app on stage
in front of you in 35 minutes.

00:35:26.530 --> 00:35:28.260
We went from custom devices--

00:35:28.260 --> 00:35:31.200
[INAUDIBLE],, really--
custom devices

00:35:31.200 --> 00:35:32.490
up and through IoT Core.

00:35:32.490 --> 00:35:34.770
Bridged into Cloud,
Cloud Pub/Sub,

00:35:34.770 --> 00:35:37.950
Cloud Functions to pull from
Pub/Sub into Cloud Firestore.

00:35:37.950 --> 00:35:40.380
Firestore firing
real time updates

00:35:40.380 --> 00:35:42.390
to power our Angular app.

00:35:42.390 --> 00:35:44.430
Google Sheets powered
by Apps Script

00:35:44.430 --> 00:35:47.280
to show us time slice
data, configure our devices

00:35:47.280 --> 00:35:50.920
with an LED that will
not shut off for me.

00:35:50.920 --> 00:35:53.600
What else did we do-- and
it configured metadata

00:35:53.600 --> 00:35:55.230
in Firestore as well.

00:35:55.230 --> 00:35:59.110
That is our end to end
simple data application

00:35:59.110 --> 00:36:00.450
all the way through.

